Package: matchfamily
Type: Package
Title: Matching and Weighting Family for jamovi
Version: 1.0.0
Author: Mingchao Sun
Maintainer: Mingchao Sun <mingchao.sun@hotmail.com>
URL: https://github.com/mingchao-sun/matchfamily
BugReports: https://github.com/mingchao-sun/matchfamily/issues
Description: Treatment-effect estimation under selection on observables for jamovi:
    propensity score and overlap, covariate balance, regression adjustment, inverse
    probability weighting, augmented IPW, IPW regression adjustment, entropy balancing and
    nearest-neighbour matching, with standard errors that account for the estimated
    propensity score or the matching, a side-by-side comparison, and sensitivity analysis
    (E-value, Rosenbaum bounds).
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    jmvcore (>= 2.3.4),
    R6,
    ggplot2
